  "details": "The introduction of rich presence for worlds and prefabs would be very helpful for anyone browsing a joinable instance.\n\nAllowing Rich Presence to be an option for world creators to optionally program in with Udon or the native VRChat SDK. For example, if a game is ongoing, allow that information to be sent to the API when a user is looking at instance info.\n\nExamples of usage:\n\n1. A game world, telling the status of whether a game is in progress, or waiting to start. (Game In Progress - <5 minutes remaining)\n\n2. A video player world, showing which video or movie is being played. (Now watching: Ready Player One)\n\n3. Displaying the location and progress of an adventure, horror, or puzzle world. (In The Cave - 66% completed.)",
